# Env files - never commit an admin portal API base URL override that
# might point at a real deployment; .env.example documents the shape.
# .env.test is the one deliberate exception: it points only at the
# isolated internal-test backend (never production), and a base URL is
# not a secret - see V1_RECONCILIATION_REPORT.md Stage A.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.test

coverage

